WEBVTT

00:08:57.491 --> 00:09:00.953
The Philadelphia Quicksteppers,
an all-Black women's basketball team,

00:09:00.995 --> 00:09:03.330
led by a legend, Inez Patterson.

00:09:03.914 --> 00:09:07.042
Patterson, she knows a thing or two
about storylines.

00:09:07.042 --> 00:09:08.919
She's ahead of her time.

00:09:08.961 --> 00:09:11.547
So she goes to the local
all-Black newspaper,

00:09:11.589 --> 00:09:13.382
"The Philadelphia Tribune,"

00:09:13.382 --> 00:09:15.634
and she proposes a deal.

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:17.428
Sponsorship.

00:09:18.012 --> 00:09:21.682
Storylines in exchange for naming rights.

00:09:22.391 --> 00:09:26.645
This may very well be the first
naming-rights deal in history.

00:09:27.396 --> 00:09:31.442
The Philadelphia Quicksteppers
become the Philadelphia Tribunes.